{"title": "Swiresy Shoes", "pageid": 7886, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Swiresy_Shoes", "categories": ["Boots", "Rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Shoes_D_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Shoes_D_Faded.png/300px-Shoes_D_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/6/60/Shoes_D_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Swiresy Shoes image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Shoes_D_Faded.png/300px-Shoes_D_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Shoes_D_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Swiresy Shoes</span></a> are a pair of rare <a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boots\">Boots</a> that improve <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jumping</a> distance and <a href=\"/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\">Acrobatics</a> skill.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Likely fashioned in tribute to the extremely small, high-vaulting rascal who pillaged many a hen house - <a href=\"/wiki/Lupperdiddle_Swires\" title=\"Lupperdiddle Swires\">Lupperdiddle Swires</a>.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" title=\"Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/38px-Boots_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/50px-Boots_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Boots\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boots\">Boots</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.55 kg (1.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.55 kg (1.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 35 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  35  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Jumping_Shoes</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Jumping_Shoes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Jumping_Shoes\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b9872a9c-d653-4108-9060-21d6d8ec511a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b9872a9c-d653-4108-9060-21d6d8ec511a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b9872a9c-d653-4108-9060-21d6d8ec511a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Jumping_Shoes</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Jumping_Shoes+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Jumping_Shoes+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Footwear_Cloth_D</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/25px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/38px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/50px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acrobatics\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/25px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\">Acrobatics</a> +1</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Vaulting\" title=\"Refined Vaulting\">Refined Vaulting</a></dt><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/25px-Jump_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/38px-Jump_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/50px-Jump_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/25px-Jump_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> distance is increased by 1.5 m (5 ft).</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-99&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;424</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grat\" title=\"Grat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/25px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/38px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/50px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grat the Trader\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/25px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grat\" title=\"Grat\">Grat the Trader</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>One of several references to the gnome adventurer Lupperdiddle Swires. Others appear in the descriptions of the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting\" title=\"Potion of Glorious Vaulting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting\" title=\"Potion of Glorious Vaulting\">Potion of Glorious Vaulting</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arsonist%27s_Oil\" title=\"Arsonist's Oil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arsonist%27s_Oil\" title=\"Arsonist's Oil\">Arsonist's Oil</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Swires%27_Sledboard\" title=\"Swires' Sledboard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Swires%27_Sledboard\" title=\"Swires' Sledboard\">Swires' Sledboard</a>. \"Swires\" is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_References\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cultural References\">reference</a> to the <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_References#Discworld\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cultural References\">Discworld</a> books.</li></ul>\n\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 341.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 339.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Swiresy_shoes_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Swiresy_shoes_dyed.png/509px-Swiresy_shoes_dyed.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Swiresy_shoes_dyed.png/764px-Swiresy_shoes_dyed.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Swiresy_shoes_dyed.png/1018px-Swiresy_shoes_dyed.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dyed variations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Swiresy_shoes_dyed.png/509px-Swiresy_shoes_dyed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"340\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Swiresy_shoes_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">Dyed</a> variations</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202220\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3186/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40410/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9654/4194304 bytes\nHighest expans